# A codicil carrying a grouping runs it on open (dynamics grammar plan,
# G4b1, F157, F161): no picker builds a composition before G4b2, so the
# receipt types in a version-3 codicil (written by graphshell's
# `print_the_grouping_receipts_codicil` and checked by
# `the_grouping_receipts_codicil_reads_and_binds`) whose scene's spec runs
# Charge between the sites' groups and Springs within, opens it as a
# session, and asserts the canvas runs the grouping on the scene's
# arrangement, playing.
assert title GRAPHSHELL H3 READY
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-composition == none
